  <data name="HidHide_NotInstalled" xml:space="preserve"><value>HidHide is not installed. Without it, some games see two controllers (the virtual one and the real DualSense) and may react to inputs twice. Click &quot;Install HidHide&quot;, confirm the Windows prompt, then restart the PC and PadPilot.</value></data>
  <data name="HidHide_Installed" xml:space="preserve"><value>When PadPilot closes or the emulation is switched off, the DualSense is released again automatically – after a crash, on the next start. If hiding doesn&apos;t work right after installing HidHide, restart the PC once.</value></data>
